  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The Sales Chain",
      "items": [
        "Lead -> Order -> PDI -> TMS -> Dispatch is one connected path, not five separate screens",
        "Named events hand off every leg: LEAD_ORDER_CONFIRMED -> ORDER_READY_FOR_PDI -> ORDER_PDI_PASSED -> ORDER_FULLY_SHIPPED",
        "Dispatch is the single point that writes a real stock-ledger Out; everything upstream only reserves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Real Double-Entry Accounting",
      "items": [
        "Receivables and Payables both post real journal entries into one GL Ledger",
        "GST is tracked as a liability, not folded into revenue; Payables carries Input Tax Credit",
        "Aging and the GSTR-shaped report are both read off the same Ledger, not separate spreadsheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "FMS \u2014 No-Code Workflow Engine",
      "items": [
        "An Admin builds any multi-step process as data: forms, lookups, a working-hours TAT calendar, branching, stock actions",
        "Listens for real business events from Inward (INWARD_ENTRY_CREATED), Production Line flows, and Purchase (INDENT_APPROVED)",
        "The single most defensible, demo-able differentiator in the product"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "One Platform, Every Org Isolated",
      "items": [
        "Multi-tenant: every table carries org_id, each signup is a fully isolated organization",
        "Admin grants gate access module-by-module, down to individual users",
        "Leave approvals auto-reassign a person's open Tasks to a named Buddy, with full audit trail"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Data-Integrity Engineering",
      "items": [
        "runInTenantTransaction takes a per-org advisory lock before any read, so competing writes across modules (Orders, Dispatch, Payables...) cannot race each other",
        "Idempotent mutations: a durable mutation_receipts table replays the same request key to the same result, so a retried payment or stock write is never double-applied",
        "getStockAvailability is the single Free-stock engine every module (Order, PPC, FMS) reads; no module computes its own stale number",
        "/api/health distinguishes schema-missing, schema-stale, and schema-divergent states without leaking connection or driver details"
      ]
    }
  ]
